    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8117" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνείρω</span></b> , (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εῐρω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fasten on</i> or <i>to,
				string,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνείρας [τὰ ὦτα] περὶ τὸν χαλινόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.118
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὰ κρέα</span>
			<i>fasten upon</i> a spit, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				201
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνώτια ἀργυρᾶ ἀνειρμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).161
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				61
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Delos</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ.
				στεφάνους</span>
			<i>twine</i> or <i>wreathe</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1006
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχας βελόνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					51.14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
